WindowServer theme PNG assets

Traffic-light buttons (close-*, minimize-*, maximize-* - 14x16 logical
pixels; states active, hover, pressed, disabled, inactive; color variant)
and the caption titlebar strips (caption-border-active/inactive - 27x23,
nine-slice margins 6 px left/right, 6 px top, 1 px bottom) are exact crops
of Aurora's Cougar artstyle atlases. The implementation spec for them is
guide_PRIVATE/windowcontrols_Ref/DESIGN-GUIDE.md; the full handoff pack
lives in guide_PRIVATE/windowcontrols_Ref/assets/.

Source: x6shell/aurora, commit 63a5efa
(https://gitgud.io/x6shell/aurora). The upstream checkout contained no
license file, so no license is asserted here; attribution and the original
atlases are retained for provenance in the lynxOS asset pack
(guide_PRIVATE/windowcontrols_Ref/assets/window-controls and
...window-decoration/caption-border).

Window shadows ( Cougar window-shadow assets: 91x91 box, 4-unit corner
radius, 6-unit downward offset, blur 32) derive from
kdecoration/cougardecoration.cpp, (c) 2026 catpswin56,
AGPL-3.0-or-later, and libbreezecommon/breezeboxshadowrenderer.cpp,
(c) 2018 Vlad Zahorodnii, GPL-2.0-or-later. They are not used by the WM
yet (openbox has no compositor).
